The package robotraconteur is compatible with built-in CMake targets:

    find_package(RobotRaconteur REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE RobotRaconteurCore)

Linux defaults to disabled hardware backends, without D-Bus/libusb/BlueZ build dependencies.
Enable robotraconteur[hardware-transport] to restore the upstream Linux hardware build.
Windows behavior, public APIs, TCP/local transports and UDP port 48653 are unchanged.
Validation code is supplied separately from the overlay.
